6
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:32.000
into therapy, maybe they had anxiety, or maybe they had an eating disorder, or maybe they were depressed, and they would end up with a therapist who said something like, well, many people I've seen with your symptoms were sexually abused as a child. And there would begin these activities that would lead these patients to start to think they remembered years of brutalization that they had allegedly banished into the unconscious until this therapy made them aware of it. And in many instances, these people sued their parents or got their former neighbors or doctors or teachers, whatever, prosecuted. based on these claims of repressed memory.

7
