and complete information from people, and we aren't wrongly convicting people of crimes they didn't do. So I see some great impact there. Is there anything we can do to prevent against false memories or to enhance our memories? Oh, you know, if you warn people that somebody might be trying to mislead them or fool them, they can momentarily protect themselves

